387 - Come, O Sabbath Day
 / 
Key: Eb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 387
Topic: Doctrines - 

Verse 1:
[Cm]Peace and healing [Fm/C]on [Eb/Bb]thy wing;
[Fm/C]And [Ab]to [Gm]every [Cm]troubled [Bb]breast
[Eb]Speak [Ddim]of [Cm/Eb]the [Eb]divine [Cm/G]behest:
[Cm/G]Thou shalt [Bb]rest, [Cm]Thou shalt rest!

Verse 2:
[Cm]Earthly longings [Fm/C]bid [Eb/Bb]retire,
[Fm/C]Quench [Ab]the [Gm]passions' [Cm/G]hurtful [Bb]fire;
[Eb]To [Ddim]the [Cm/Eb]wayward, [Fm]sin [Cm/G]oppressed,
[Eb]Bring [Ddim]thou [Cm/Eb]thy [Eb]divine [Cm/G]behest:
[Cm/G]Thou shalt [Bb]rest, [Cm]Thou shalt rest!

Verse 3:
[Cm]Wipe from every cheek [Ab]the [Eb/G]tear,
[Fm/C]Banish [Gm]care [Cm]and silence [Bb]fear;
[Eb]All [Ddim]things [Cm/Eb]working [Fm]for [Cm/G]the best,
[Eb]Teach [Ddim]us [Cm/Eb]the [Eb]divine [Cm/G]behest:
[Cm/G]Thou shalt [Bb]rest, [Cm]Thou shalt rest!
